nt.\n- **Enforcement**: red-first recorded artifact in fix commits, monthly report-only `cargo-mutants` as mechanical backstop.\n- **Rejected with rationale**: PGlite (single-connection), pg-embed/postgresql_embedded (nextest process-per-test; Docker already mandatory), testcontainers, UI snapshot testing.\n\nImplementation starts with Phase 0 as a follow-up PR.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","files":null}]}